Scope of This Project's Original Work
-------------------------------------

The original work of this project consists of:

  - wx_export.py     Decryption orchestration, message parsing (including zstd
                     decompression of compressed message payloads), media/app
                     message title extraction, incremental export, and the
                     JSON event output format.
  - install.py       Cross-platform environment detection and initialization
                     assistant (macOS and Windows), including automatic key
                     extraction on Windows.
  - setup.sh         macOS initialization flow (re-signing and key extraction).
  - Documentation    README.md, AGENT-INSTALL.md, WINDOWS-TEST.md.

